			<div class="content" id="post-content-4846759">
									

<p>1) Don't provide hints; be obvious. Be as straightforward as possible.</p>
<p>2) &quot;Central narrative&quot; isn't how it will be presented, it's the story of the item in question. How you will be formatting is under the &quot;Page Layout&quot; section; we need to know the history of the item, and you haven't really provided anything. Sure, we know it's supposed to work, but we know nothing of the item itself. That's a major issue here.</p>
<p>3) All you've done under &quot;Hook&quot; is tell us more about formatting, and not why we should care about the item. In music, the hook is that initial riff that grabs someone and doesn't let go; There's none of that here. You've given a brief description of what it does and then nothing but formatting. We need a reason to care about this thing. Give us on!</p>

