<p>In terms of how it works, it looks pretty solid. The two basic problems are the hook and the why.</p>
<p>The Why: It would be interesting why the reality warper created this tool. Sure, there's the possibility of it happened randomly, but that's no fun; there has to be a reason for why it exists, be it a tool, a weapon, or even a puzzle. In short, there has to be a reason why it exists. In that regard, it would be interesting to see what the others looked like and see if there was some sort of pattern to them.</p>
<p>The Hook: Testing would have been discontinued once the majority of rules were figured out so as to avoid it teleporting. What you need is a reason for people to care about it, what it says about the SPC-U as a whole, or just what kind of niche it fills. In short, why testing was discontinued just isn't interesting when the reason is somewhat obvious, and if it isn't obvious then it needs to be stated.</p>
<p>There just needs to be a reason for people to care about the item.</p>

