			<div class="content" id="post-content-4846718">
									

<blockquote>
<p>why it should be contained?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>The Foundation contains all anomalies, no matter how mundane. That's just what the Foundation does. In this case, a coupon that causes immediate delivery of the ordered item is pretty clearly anomalous.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Second why its an object class keter? It could be very well classified as safe.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Presumably because the coupon code changes daily, so it's near impossible to reliably contain.</p>

