			<div class="content" id="post-content-4846717">
									

<p>Okay, theres a lot of missing things here but let's go.</p>
<p>First if its just a coupon that delivers what you ordered, why it should be contained? I just don't see why the Foundation should be interested.</p>
<p>Second why its an object class keter? It could be very well classified as safe.</p>
<p>Also take a look at the forum guidelines like the staff said to create a proper idea for feedback. <sub><strong>;)</strong></sub></p>

