									</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zanilo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7117511); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7117511&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608191470" alt="Zanilo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7117511)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zanilo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7117511); return false;" >Zanilo</a></span> <span class="odate time_1608181629 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">17 Dec 2020 05:07</span>
																	<br/>
						in discussion <a href="/forum/c-89000/help:ideas-critique">Writing Help / Help: Ideas Critique</a> &raquo;
						<a href="/forum/t-13942591/concept:ever-burning-flames">Concept : Ever Burning Flames.</a>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4846715">
									

<p>So essentially its like amaterasu that can be used with the Mangekyō Sharingan from naruto, right? But green.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>He and his family escaped there apartment as the fire was spreading. Then, it shows there experience about being in a zone of infinite place.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I really don't understand the part that you talk about the &quot;infinite place&quot;. They were in the apartment and them they escape? The &quot;infinite place&quot; is an anomaly linked to the green flames?</p>
<p>I think you should try adding more original elements to the narrative, and that could even explain how the guy escapes. You have to tie that two points for that to work. And how the Foundation was able to countain it? You could use that in your story too.</p>
<p>Maybe instead of just fire, it could be a sensient anomaly. Its alive and when it burns something its <em>eating</em> it. It could sustain itself only with living organisms. The citys remais intact, but the people are vurned alive. And if the Foundation was able to countain it, the SCP could pose a question to the ethics comitee: should they <em>feed</em> the fire and avoid it to breakout?</p>
<p>I think you could improve a lot your idea!</p>
<p>Have a great day!</p>
<p><sub><strong>:D</strong></sub></p>

							</div>

								
					
